severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0444"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-05-24T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:51:44Z","remediation":"升级到 JetAdmin 6.1 或更高版本，应用官方安全补丁以修复服务拒绝漏洞。可通过 JetAdmin 管理控制台禁用不必要的端口（关闭 8000 端口）或配置防火墙规则限制访问源。临时代理措施：启用 JetAdmin 的服务自动重启功能，使用基于状态的监控来检测服务异常，确保应急响应团队及时采取行动。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-23T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-05/0277.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1246","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/19965","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/20ad1fe1013ca96ea2384f289b4316baeb76e2fc/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0444.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0444","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/f7d503345a02e01eaaf915c0e3939c46f947a88c/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0444.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/88dff62b57cbb639f2b0714fb489ef14e49d5b06/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0444.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/d1d7ac405f2460acf0b0e8ed2a5cf8c748023246/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-7755-v4fr-vrxx/GHSA-7755-v4fr-vrxx.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-0444.json","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/SpeeDr00t/speedr00t.github.com/blob/0380f0c2190556fabe90257cb6c0034a42f68951/securityfocus/0x2000/1246/info.html","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_152400_152500.json","https://github.com/andreafioraldi/ToolsForCyberChallenge/blob/197d3dfd204cf1b9d1af1451455c8831c3ff9948/generated/files_5.list.dict"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0365.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0362","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0362.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0443","title":"HP Web JetAdmin 目录遍历漏洞","description":"HP Web JetAdmin 5.6 的 Web 界面服务器存在目录遍历漏洞，未经身份认证的远程攻击者可以通过 ..（点号点号）路径遍历攻击，向目标服务器发送包含特制目录跳转序列的 HTTP 请求，从而绕过访问控制读取服务器上的任意文件内容。该漏洞影响 HP JetAdmin 5.5.177 及 5.6 版本，攻击者无需任何凭据即可在远程执行读取操作，可能导致敏感配置文件、密码文件或商业数据泄露，CVSS 评分 7.5，危害等级高。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0443"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-05-24T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:51:44Z","remediation":"升级 HP Web JetAdmin 至 7.x 或更高版本，或迁移至 HP 支持的生命周期管理工具（如 HP iLO）。若无法立即升级，应在防火墙层禁用 8000 端口的对外访问，仅允许受信管理网段访问；同时删除或重命名 JetAdmin Web 接口目录中不必要的 CGI 脚本，或在配置文件 `jetadmin.ini` 中禁用 Web 界面服务。临时缓解措施还包括在反向代理或主机层面对包含 `../` 的 URL 请求进行过滤拦截，防止目录遍历攻击。鉴于 HP Web JetAdmin 5.5.x/5.6 已长期停止安全更新，长期方案应逐步淘汰该产品并迁移至受支持的服务器远程管理方案。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-23T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-05/0281.html","http://www.osvdb.org/1350","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1243","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/19956","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/1f2f850a48475dab7b1e1b1c322080edeefb8fa2/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0443.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0443","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/8ebd6486a02ca9f434893ea11941a54d5b5dfa32/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0443.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/98bfa0c64da76a68ffd6d214f436c90f142d4964/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0443.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/d1d7ac405f2460acf0b0e8ed2a5cf8c748023246/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-g827-fm54-46xv/GHSA-g827-fm54-46xv.json","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/4731f60845c8f35e2bdb03d333a9e9d84c7b1c27/content/CVE-2000-0443.md","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-0443.json","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--86b5e25c-27a0-4985-919f-2c0b3b4fa039.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/CVE-Easy-List/blob/5bfdaaa57cdca7d658e715226da4768aa7464dcc/2000.tsv"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0362.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0361","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0361.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0442","title":"Cobalt RaQ qpopper 格式字符串权限提升漏洞","description":"Qpopper 2.53 及更早版本存在格式字符串漏洞，攻击者可在邮件的 From 头部构造格式化字符串，当系统通过 euidl 命令处理该邮件时触发漏洞，导致格式化字符串被传递至输出函数执行，造成未授权内存读写。该漏洞影响 Qpopper 2.52、2.53 及更早版本，同时波及 Cobalt RaQ 2.0/3.0 等使用受影响 qpopper 的服务器。攻击条件为攻击者需具备目标系统的 POP3 账户或本地访问权限，能够向系统提交包含恶意 From 头的邮件。利用成功后攻击者可提升到更高系统权限执行任意命令，造成严重的系统安全风险。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0442"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-05-24T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:51:44Z","remediation":"将 qpopper 升级到 2.53_1 或更高版本。受影响版本包括 2.53 及更早版本，2.53_1 已修复此漏洞。如暂时无法升级，可通过在邮件客户端中禁用 UIDL/EUIDL 命令作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-23T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-05/0267.html","http://www.novell.com/linux/security/advisories/suse_security_announce_51.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1242","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/19955","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/3a2f85f8ac60847cbc2b69c575be49a8e5667923/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0442.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0442","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/80b9e46bc035d31d1e13fdb38c5f781e8a013488/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0442.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/3249236c34411e31ff9cfd40b20136dbc5077a03/