yfocus.com/bid/1245","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/19957","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/7a274ec07043f54c07d0a3b5c7fc89ba5793f023/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0396.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0396","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2000-0396.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/1decc7ade63192f9f527bfb87145d1636c01cc59/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0396.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/7007cbf91cfd56bead27c222fc520c733ed0ad71/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-73vq-vfrf-93x8/GHSA-73vq-vfrf-93x8.json","https://github.com/rhuitl/uClinux/blob/0486e80a025dccbe4a2213715a2ab8a5063ea86b/user/snort/drop-rules/web-misc.rules","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-0396.json","https://github.com/leego972/titanai/blob/afa5b2310463aae5781d3fd9408071bf38e79806/data/raw/corpus_D_cyber/nvd_cve_001403.txt","https://github.com/andreafioraldi/ToolsForCyberChallenge/blob/197d3dfd204cf1b9d1af1451455c8831c3ff9948/generated/files_2.list.dict","https://github.com/akabe1/windows_exploit_dowser/blob/11b24e36173cd382721db28581e575faf687d06b/cve_from_exploitdb_website.csv"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2000/POC-AVE-2000-0326.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0326.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-1200","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-1200.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0551","title":"Danware NetOp 6.0 文件传输机制未授权访问漏洞","description":"Danware NetOp 6.0 的文件传输机制缺乏身份认证功能，远程攻击者无需任何凭证即可通过网络访问并任意读写目标系统上的文件。该漏洞允许攻击者上传恶意文件或下载敏感数据，对系统机密性、完整性和可用性均造成完全破坏。攻击条件简单，仅需目标开启文件传输服务且网络可达即可利用，无需用户交互。CVSS 评分 10.0，危害等级严重。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":10.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0551"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-05-23T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:51:58Z","remediation":"立即升级 Danware NetOp 至 6.0 以上版本（如 7.0 或更高），该漏洞在后续版本中已加入文件传输认证机制。如无法升级，在防火墙中限制对 NetOp 文件传输端口（默认 TCP 6502/UDP 6502）的访问，仅允许受信任 IP 连接，并禁用不必要的文件传输功能作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-05/0339.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1263","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/4569","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/15ba52d0829fe2220e9f89276b2743c7eef0ab2a/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0551.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0551","https://github.com/fankh/vulnerability-poc/blob/04aa22fbb624898c1d0928bc3b34fb05529275cb/2000/CVE-2000-0551/README.md","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/291c09f8f1fb3b2fa866c7b93e7660471419cef8/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0551.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/6cdd862a65f157a01ff9fd42e651329142c691d2/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0551.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/fa1c2f93b0d15da115c038738e571c1a1553b4cc/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-52wv-9457-3g76/GHSA-52wv-9457-3g76.json","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-0551.json","https://github.com/leego972/titanai/blob/afa5b2310463aae5781d3fd9408071bf38e79806/data/raw/corpus_D_cyber/nvd_cve_001402.txt","https://github.com/fankh/vulnerability-poc/blob/04aa22fbb624898c1d0928bc3b34fb05529275cb/2000/CVE-2000-0551/poc.py"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2000/POC-AVE-2000-1200.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-1200.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0343","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0343.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0418","title":"Cayman 3220-H DSL Router ICMP Ping 数据包拒绝服务漏洞","description":"Cayman 3220-H DSL 路由器存在 ICMP 数据包处理缺陷，远程攻击者可通过发送超大的 ICMP Echo（Ping）请求包触发缓冲区溢出，导致路由器崩溃或重启，造成拒绝服务。该漏洞无需身份认证即可远程利用，攻击条件简单，仅需发送特制的大尺寸 Ping 包即可生效，影响所有运行受影响固件版本的 Cayman 3220-H 设备。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0418"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-05-23T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:51:40Z","remediation":"该设备已停止技术支持，无官方固件更新。建议在网络边界防火墙或路由器上配置 ACL 规则，丢弃 ICMP 数据包长度超过正常范围（如超过 65507 字节）的请求，或直接限制 ICMP 报文速率。如业务允许，可在边界防火墙上完全禁用入站 ICMP echo request 以彻底消除风险。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-23T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-05/0280.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1240","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/324","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/2ee9e77ceac534c670c42073c99286dbb69e9733/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0418.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0418","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/4731f60845c8f35e2bdb03d333a9e9d84c7b1c27/content/CVE-2000-0418.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/c872795777255e25a47f155fd6d323c05ea13ab9/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0418.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/daf3a08cbe0139b666db9d48681b6efcebbecad5/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-f76v-57j8-425v/GHSA-f76v-57j8-425v.json","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_152400_152500.json","https://github.com/andreafioraldi/ToolsForCyberChallenge/blob/197d3dfd204cf1b9d1af1451455c8831c3ff9948/generated/files_1.list.dict","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--2bad86d6-fd83-48af-915a-2df8fe7018fa.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/a036095fb2c093f3863681adc5999690c37b930e/nvdcve/CVE-2000-0418.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0343.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0466","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0466.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0431","title":"Cobalt RaQ 2/3 安全绕过漏洞","description":"Cobalt RaQ2 和 RaQ3 服务器在处理 FrontPage 上传文件时，未正确设置文件访问权限和所有权，导致攻击者可绕过 cgiwrap 安全机制，直接修改服务器上的文件。该漏洞影响 Cobalt RaQ2 和 RaQ3 服务器产品，攻击者无需身份认证即可通过网络远程利用，攻击复杂度低，成功利用可导致文件被篡改，影响系统的机密性、完整性和可用性，CVSS 评分 7.5（高危）。攻击者可通过 FrontPage 上传功能上传恶意文件，利用权限配置缺陷绕过 cgiwrap 保护，进而修改或覆盖服务器上的关键文件，实现权限提升或破坏服务完整性。Sun Microsystems 已发布补丁修复此漏洞，建议受影响用户尽快升级至修复版本。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0431"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-05-22T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:51:43Z","remediation":"建议立即升级 Cobalt RaQ 服务器至最新固件版本（建议升级至 RaQ 4 或更高版本，或迁移至现代 Linux 服务器平台）。临时缓解措施：1) 在 Web 服务器配置中禁用 FrontPage Server Extensions；2) 手动修复上传目录权限，确保上传文件所有者为 Web 用户且权限设为 644，目录权限 755；3) 配置 cgiwrap 正确限制 CGI 脚本权限；4) 在防火墙层面限制非必要的管理端口访问。建议尽快迁移至现代 Linux 服务器（如 CentOS/Ubuntu + Apache/Nginx），Cobalt RaQ 系列已于 2000 年代停止支持。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-23T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-05/0305.html","http://www.osvdb.org/1346","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1238","http://www.securityfocus.com/templates/archive.pike?list=1&msg=20000523100045.B11049%40HiWAAY.net","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/ed228d55b7972f63e700a35a54fbcd94064b9ade/2000/CVE-2000-0431.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/9615a84be27b28681e8a92dcc11ff360547df421/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0431.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0431","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/2bf475c962629ec6f02e5caa819697d3f035d100/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0431.json","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/2000/CVE-2000-0431.md","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/bd18194e7d4afd6af63b4895317531a574628e62/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-7qpm-q5rp-cvqf/GHSA-7qpm-q5rp-cvqf.json","https://github.com/xqcyberscore/nvt/blob/978f6a9acb495d7d669239530ffe6da5d631f4da/pre2008/cgiwrap.nasl","https://github.com/rhuitl/uClinux/blob/0486e80a025dccbe4a2213715a2ab8a5063ea86b/user/snort/drop-rules/sid-msg.map","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-0431.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2000/POC-AVE-2000-0466.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0466.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0358","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0358.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0438","title":"S.u.S.E. Linux 等发行版 fdmount 本地缓冲区溢出漏洞","description":"fdmount 是 Linux 系统中用于挂载软盘设备的工具，该工具在处理 mountpoint 参数时存在缓冲区溢出漏洞，以 \"floppy\" 组成员身份登录的本地攻击者可通过传入超长的挂载点路径参数触发溢出，进而以 root 权限执行任意命令。该漏洞影响 S.u.S.E. 4.x/5.x/6.x/7.x、Slackware 3.x/4.0、Turbolinux 6 以及 OpenLinux 7.0 等 Linux 发行版，CVSS v2 评分 7.2，危害等级高。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.2,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0438"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-05-22T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:51:44Z","remediation":"对于 fdmount 缓冲区溢出漏洞（CVE-2000-0438），应立即移除 fdmount 程序的 SUID 权限：执行 chmod u-s /usr/bin/fdmount 或用 ls -l /usr/bin/fdmount 确认 SUID 位已清除。同时将 floppy 组中非必要用户移除：执行 gpasswd -d <用户名> floppy，仅保留必须使用软驱的账户。如厂商已发布补丁，应升级至 fdmount 修复版本（如 S.u.S.E.、Slackware、Turbolinux、OpenLinux 及 Mandrake Linux 发行版安全更新）以彻底消除该漏洞。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-23T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-05/0245.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1239","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/19954","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/9eab3e49abff7d8657a641d028b9281334f27eaa/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0438.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0438","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/4731f60845c8f35e2bdb03d333a9e9d84c7b1c27/content/CVE-2000-0438.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/ee8b01743dd7b9fb9124ebc430ff19a67c89c1a6/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0438.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/905c759ea25c11a59e5c85d4af57ced286cebb3a/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-fg2g-48g8-4xwm/GHSA-fg2g-48g8-4xwm.json","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_152400_152500.json","https://github.com/andreafioraldi/ToolsForCyberChallenge/blob/197d3dfd204cf1b9d1af1451455c8831c3ff9948/generated/files_2.list.dict","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--e333a498-73f8-4d6b-a227-25c89776a724.json","https://github.com/leego972/titanai/blob/afa5b2310463aae5781d3fd9408071bf38e79806/data/raw/corpus_D_cyber/nvd_cve_001400.txt"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2000/POC-AVE-2000-0358.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2000/EXP-AVE-2000-0358.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0358.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0373","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0373.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0451","title":"Intel Express 8100 ISDN路由器ICMP数据包拒绝服务漏洞","description":"Intel Express 8100 ISDN 路由器存在 ICMP 数据包处理漏洞，该设备在接收到超大或分片的 ICMP 数据包时未能正确处理，导致系统崩溃或无响应。未经身份认证的远程攻击者可向目标路由器发送特制的超大 ICMP Echo 请求（ping）或分片 ICMP 数据包，触发设备异常并造成拒绝服务，使路由器停止转发网络流量，影响所有通过该设备的网络通信。该漏洞影响所有运行原始固件的 Intel Express 8100 ISDN 路由器，由于攻击只需网络可达且无需任何认证，威胁程度较高。目前厂商已停止对该设备的支持，建议升级至不受影响的替代产品。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0451"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-05-19T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:51:45Z","remediation":"该漏洞影响已停产的 Intel Express 8100 ISDN 路由器硬件设备，Intel 未发布固件补丁。建议采取以下措施：1）在上游防火墙或路由器上配置访问控制列表（ACL）过滤所有入站 ICMP 流量，阻止超大分片和分片 ICMP 包到达该设备；2）将该设备替换为支持 ICMP 分片防护的现代路由器或防火墙（如 Cisco ISR 系列或 Palo Alto 防火墙），并在新设备上启用 ICMP 分片检测与丢弃策略；3）如短期无法替换设备，使用网络入侵检测系统（IDS/IPS）部署针对分片 ICMP DoS 攻击的检测规则，并限制仅授权管理 IP 可访问该路由器的管理接口。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-24T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-05/0229.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1228","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/19943","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/d83a2c403dbad5ade9ae20db8a18ec06947c25f6/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0451.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0451","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/f7d503345a02e01eaaf915c0e3939c46f947a88c/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0451.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/3e56369e6f703dfde20132e3205d609e016e88bd/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0451.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/d1d7ac405f2460acf0b0e8ed2a5cf8c748023246/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-q6wc-wpm6-pf8j/GHSA-q6wc-wpm6-pf8j.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-0451.json","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_152400_152500.json","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--ebe12690-ee45-4401-b2f5-a809a7adaa87.json","https://github.com/wisoffe/exploits-predict/blob/5a78ced1357472afaaece2c8acf2b8b68f9ede8d/notebooks/02-ik-initial-eda--data-analysis.ipynb"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0373.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0355","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0355.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0436","title":"MetaProducts Offline Explorer 1.0.x/1.1.x/1.2.x 目录遍历漏洞 (CVE-2000-0436)","description":"MetaProducts Offline Explorer 1.0.x/1.1.x/1.2.x 版本存在目录遍历漏洞，远程攻击者无需身份认证即可通过发送包含 \"..\" (点点) 序列的特制 HTTP 请求，绕过目录限制读取服务器文件系统上的任意文件。该漏洞源于软件对用户输入的路径参数缺乏有效过滤和规范化验证，攻击者可利用相对路径遍历序列访问 Web 根目录之外的敏感文件，如系统配置文件、源代码或数据库文件。漏洞影响 Offline Explorer 1.2 及更早版本，CVSS 评分 5.0 (AV:N/AC:L/Au:N/C:P/I:N/A:N)，属于中等严重度漏洞，攻击复杂度低、无需认证、仅影响机密性。攻击者可通过构造包含 ../ 序列的 URL 请求实现任意文件读取，可能导致敏感信息泄露。MetaProducts 官方已发布更新版本修复此漏洞，建议用户升级至 1.3 或更高版本。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0436"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-05-19T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:51:43Z","remediation":"建议立即升级 MetaProducts Offline Explorer 到 1.3 及以上版本（官方已修复目录遍历漏洞），可从 MetaProducts 官网下载最新版本并覆盖安装。如暂时无法升级，请在 Web 服务器/防火墙层面配置规则拦截包含 ../ 或 ..\\ 的请求路径，并限制 Offline Explorer 服务的文件系统访问权限至指定目录，禁止访问 Web 根目录以外的文件系统路径。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-23T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-05/0254.html","http://www.metaproducts.com/mpOE-HY.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1231","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/19945","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/4358541c3df4f2ba1793e172c3d7c89ba338eded/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0436.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0436","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-pla